  "scope": "Actual pinned N64 Wasm engine with only the repository MIT diagnostic ROM. Marker-free near-boot preflight refusal is distinct from a reached fault; a later full-file-read/no-deserialize case uses explicit controlled RAM. WebAudio and post-commit IDB failures are injected.",
